2 CONT Dombok entry (from Geni andnd:  Kråken): Dmb1682 16/1: Anders Svensson from Gammelbyn, Burträsk parish has purchased from wife (hustru) Anna, Lars Andersson's widow in Webbomark, her indebted homestead (hemman), 1681-05-15.
