2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT From Geni: Farmer and tolvman (grand juror), 1658-1697. Owned homestead (hemmanet) at Bodyn 7, Burträsk. Appears in Bodbyn 1658-1688 on Mantal. (tax rolls). Married and widower in 1659: "A. Åsvidsson gave after his blessed wife a 
2 CONC silver spoon of two lead and 3 mark copper coins." Married (2) N. Svensdotter of Gammelbyn 2 1659. Died 1701 at Bodyn 7.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dmb (Dombok, a Court Judgment Book) in 1692, Skellefteå mentions Anders Åsvedsson in Bodbyn and sons Lars and Jacob (see profile for Anders' son, Lars Andersson). Anders Arvidsson mentioned in Mantal. (tax) records from 1658 to 16
2 CONC 94 with wife, 1-4 sons, and no daughters (Kråken). Other Dombok entries from 1660-1681 appear in Geni.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dmb 1673 28/10: regarding the incident that grand juror (tolvman) Anders Åssvedsson, at Bodbyn, has come to know: that a few years ago he tore the hair and beard of his father-in-law, Sven Nilsson at Gammelbyn, for which the sheri
2 CONC ff requests that A. be duly punished. Anders could not deny. Johan Jonsson, from Lappvattnet, testified that the father-in-law and Lars Jonsson, at Bodbyn, came from Umeå and had entered and fought each other in Brände village, we
2 CONC re all drunk and as Johan and Sven's mother-in-law were to separate them, had Anders Fuller taken some of his father-in-law's beard... this took place 12 or 13 years ago... the court should not try A.Å. for this with a penalty but
2 CONC  should be canceled as a matter of added danger (våda tillkommen).
2 CONT
2 CONT Double ancestor: Anders' sons Lars and Jacob are both are ancestors, so we are related to Anders through both of these sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT Conflicting names of parents. Geni shows Anders' wife is unknown, and that is father is Arvid Olsson. Familysearch shows wife Margareta Larsdotter, parents Asvid Nilsson and Sara Mattsdotter, and grandparents Nils Åsvedsson. The d
2 CONC ates also differ. A note in familysearch mention the information is from Gunda Lundström, with research from a "Finnish researcher." No primary sources are given in either case, so they must be suspect for now.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Burträsk Byar och gårdar 1539-1800" (2007), p. 77, Bodbyn 7, Burträsk.  Dombok entries.
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 259217 gives sources Mantalslängd (tax) records (birth), and Testp. (death); notes has summary of Mantal. records, 1658-88 and 1692 dombok entry.
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LZDF-NBP
