2 CONT Among his many accomplishments, Anders Hackzell mapped the area of Kiruna in 1736.   He named the mountains of the area Fredriks berg (Finnish: Kiirunavaara) and Berget Ulrika Eleonora (Finnish: Luossavaara), after the King of Swe
2 CONC den Fredrik I and his wife Ulrika Eleonora.
