1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Translated from https://genvagar.nu/show.asp?PersonId=671604 (WITHOUT sources):
2 CONT
2 CONT "Olof Olofsson Krigsbuss born Bursiljum, Burträsk. Probably died in Finland? He was assigned to the company and rote 27/87 Krigsbuss for Åbyn in 1767 and he was 25 years old and married to Brita Jonsdotter b.1735 Hjoggböle 1 d.181
2 CONC 2-06-20 Burträsk, he was 5 feet and 8 inches tall and he served in the company until 1788, but the rota then became vacant and apparently he was sent to the war in southern Finland and disappeared there.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Children:
2 CONT *Olof b.1762-12-12 Åbyn?
2 CONT *Christina b.1767-08-18
2 CONT *Jonas b.1769-08-03 Åbyn
2 CONT *Brita Christina b.1770-11-18 Åbyn
2 CONT *Cathrins b.1772-04-21 Åbyn
2 CONT *Olaus b.1773-12-11 Åbyn
2 CONT *Petrus b.1775-07-05 Åbyn
2 CONT *Anders b.1777-07-22 Åbyn"
