1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wife (hustru) of Olof Andersson, and blind.
2 CONT Death notice (from Kråken notes): January 1730, the night before 1729-12-26 died and on 1730-01-18 the parish clerk (sockenskrivaren) Olof Fattenborg's wife Barbro Olofsdotter was buried in the church, where the late pastor Nicola
2 CONC us Eurenii had previously been buried -- 12 dal silver coins that were issued pastor's certificate of deportation and therefore now not occupied. (attest av utvisar och därför nu intet uptagen)."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå byar och gårdar 1600 - 1800" (1999).
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 199226 gives source DB C:2.28 (birth year and death), Household exam records for Lövnger AI:1.29 (1705-11) and  AI:2.36 (1712-17).
2 CONT
